sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Vercel app in Electron
    participant MAIN as Native main process
    participant BROWSER as System browser
    participant AUTH as Supabase Auth and Google
    UI->>MAIN: Trusted main-frame sign-in request
    MAIN->>MAIN: Create PKCE verifier and random loopback path
    MAIN->>BROWSER: Open Supabase Google authorization URL
    BROWSER->>AUTH: Employee completes Google sign-in
    AUTH-->>BROWSER: Redirect with code to loopback callback
    BROWSER->>MAIN: GET random path on 127.0.0.1:17584
    MAIN->>AUTH: Exchange code with PKCE verifier
    AUTH-->>MAIN: User session
    MAIN-->>UI: Session through isolated IPC bridge
    MAIN->>MAIN: Close listener and clear memory
    UI->>AUTH: Authenticated workspace membership check
